    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ugroempi/CAs/zipball/v0.25",
    "body": "Important changes are listed in NEWS.md. Most relevant in terms of content: \r\n\r\n* incorporate smolenBigFrame (for now used on request only), \r\n* added construction by Mickael Bergeron (which includes the long-standing Raaphorst-Moura-Stevens construction as a special case), \r\n* added further `powerCT` constructions (those with `S` and a few more); \r\n* added the best `derive`, `fuse` and `add1` constructions to `Ns` and thus to `bestN` and `bestCA`, \r\n* added `ingredients` element to the attributes of various class `ca` objects (the class needs further development, though)."
  },
